    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0fBe advised , the game will be only in french\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Welcome to Show Quiz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to put your neurons to the test in Show Quiz, the dynamic, fast-paced quiz game that combines general knowledge and sharp reflexes! Show Quiz features over 60000 questions covering a multitude of topics, from the sharpest to the wackiest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa4 At the helm of the show, the inimitable Jack Pot, charismatic presenter with boundless energy, will take you through an over-the-top game experience between punchlines and rising tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Progression system: Earn XP and level up with each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Rank system: Your rank depends on the average of your right (and wrong) answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Nervous gameplay: Answer fast, chain questions, beat your record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Upcoming multiplayer: Multiplayer mode lands in version 2.0 - get ready to take on your friends (or foes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to challenge Jack Pot and prove you're the true quizmaster?\ud83c\udfae Show Quiz is waiting for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0fBe advised , the game will be only in french\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Welcome to Show Quiz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to put your neurons to the test in Show Quiz, the dynamic, fast-paced quiz game that combines general knowledge and sharp reflexes! Show Quiz features over 60000 questions covering a multitude of topics, from the sharpest to the wackiest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa4 At the helm of the show, the inimitable Jack Pot, charismatic presenter with boundless energy, will take you through an over-the-top game experience between punchlines and rising tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Progression system: Earn XP and level up with each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Rank system: Your rank depends on the average of your right (and wrong) answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Nervous gameplay: Answer fast, chain questions, beat your record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Upcoming multiplayer: Multiplayer mode lands in version 2.0 - get ready to take on your friends (or foes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to challenge Jack Pot and prove you're the true quizmaster?\ud83c\udfae Show Quiz is waiting for you!</p>",
